#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:62
msgid "Configure Backup at Provision Time"
msgstr "Configurar Backup no Momento do Provisionamento"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:64
msgid ""
"When provisioning an Instance into a Cloud where Commvault is set as the "
"backup provider, Commvault will be selectable as the \"Backup Type\" on "
"the Automation tab of the provisioning wizard. Expand the Backups section"
" on this tab and enter the following:"
msgstr "Ao provisionar uma Instância em uma Nuvem onde o Commvault está definido como o provedor de backup, o Commvault será selecionável como o \"Backup Type\" na aba Automation do assistente de provisionamento. Expanda a seção Backups nesta aba e informe o seguinte:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:66
msgid "**Backup Type:** Select the desired Commvault backup type"
msgstr "**Backup Type:** Selecione o tipo de backup Commvault desejado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Backup Server:** Select the desired server synced from the Commvault "
"backup provider associated with the Cloud"
msgstr "**Backup Server:** Selecione o servidor desejado sincronizado do provedor de backup Commvault associado à Nuvem"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Backup Set:** Select a configured backup set synced from the Commvault "
"backup provider associated with the Cloud"
msgstr "**Backup Set:** Selecione um backup set configurado sincronizado do provedor de backup Commvault associado à Nuvem"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Storage Policy:** Gold, Silver, or Bronze. Select the applicable SLA or"
" retention policy for the workload being provisioned. The meanings of "
"these retention tiers are configurable in Commvault"
msgstr "**Storage Policy:** Gold, Silver ou Bronze. Selecione o SLA ou política de retenção aplicável à carga de trabalho sendo provisionada. Os significados desses tiers de retenção são configuráveis no Commvault"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Backup Name:** A name for the backup in |morpheus|, this field is pre-"
"populated with the Instance name but can be overwritten"
msgstr "**Backup Name:** Um nome para o backup no |morpheus|; este campo é pré-preenchido com o nome da Instância, mas pode ser sobrescrito"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Backup Job Type:** Clone an existing backup job (Backups > Jobs) or add"
" this backup to an existing job. A job contains a retention count and "
"backup frequency schedule and can have as many Instances backing up under"
" it as needed"
msgstr "**Backup Job Type:** Clonar um backup job existente (Backups > Jobs) ou adicionar este backup a um job existente. Um job contém uma contagem de retenção e um agendamento de frequência de backup e pode ter quantas Instâncias fazendo backup sob ele forem necessárias"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Backup Job:** Select the job which will be cloned or have a backup "
"added to it depending on your selection in the prior field"
msgstr "**Backup Job:** Selecione o job que será clonado ou ao qual um backup será adicionado, dependendo da sua seleção no campo anterior"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/commvault.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Job Name:** A name for the new cloned job (if you are cloning and not "
"creating a new Backup Job)"
msgstr "**Job Name:** Um nome para o novo job clonado (se você estiver clonando e não criando um novo Backup Job)"

